---
---

<section id="cta" class="section cta-section">
  <div class="gradient-line"></div>
  
  <div class="container cta-container reveal">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <div class="cta-icon-wrap">
        <svg class="success-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
          <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <h2 class="cta-title">
        Pronto para inovar?<br />
        Leve sua clínica para o <span class="text-blue-highlight">próximo nível</span>.
      </h2>
      
      <p class="cta-subtitle">
        Junte-se às assessorias de SST que já estão entregando conformidade com eficiência. Com o SEGURAMENT, você gera mais valor, automatiza processos e fideliza seus clientes.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="https://form.respondi.app/i6Erssez" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-cta">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          Blindar Minha Clínica e Meus Clientes Agora
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="cta-contact">
        <svg class="phone-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
        Fale com nossa equipe técnica e veja como integrar o SEGURAMENT à sua operação em tempo recorde.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Background subtle grid -->
    <div class="bg-grid-overlay"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-section {
    background-color: var(--bg-soft);
    position: relative;
    padding: 140px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .gradient-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--blue), transparent);
  }

  .cta-container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-inner {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .cta-icon-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    background: rgba(0, 74, 173, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 74, 173, 0.3);
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 74, 173, 0.15);
    animation: successPulse 2s infinite ease-in-out;
  }

  @keyframes successPulse {
    0%, 100% { 
      transform: scale(1);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 74, 173, 0.15);
    }
    50% { 
      transform: scale(1.08);
      box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(0, 74, 173, 0.25);
      border-color: rgba(0, 74, 173, 0.5);
    }
  }

  .success-icon {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
  }

  .cta-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .text-blue-highlight {
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  .cta-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn-cta {
    padding: 20px 48px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    background-color: var(--blue);
    border: 1px solid var(--blue-light);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 74, 173, 0.4);
    animation: ctaPulse 2s infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes ctaPulse {
    0% { box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 74, 173, 0.3); }
    100% { box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(0, 74, 173, 0.6); }
  }

  .btn-cta:hover {
    background-color: var(--blue-light);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .cta-contact {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .phone-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bg-grid-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(var(--border-light) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 40px 40px;
    opacity: 0.5;
    z-index: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .btn-cta {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
